      "id": "claim_48406ec1deba4e079d4c287cbb0ca17b",
      "statement": "At interpreter startup, the repository's `sitecustomize` hook appends every numbered chapter directory to `sys.path` and anchors `ML4T_DATA_PATH` independently of the process working directory; the module is packaged as a top-level Python module so supported installs can auto-load it.",
